model r7_reach
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
  note "T, tally 2.1.7, R7's reach (#146), from L §8.2's One read set alone: an entry is listed under a result exactly when a read in its set gives it, the reads that decided a movement doesn't count (a false when) included. Features no item of R7 names: an assumed row read only through a move's false when (a_*: listed under the balance that tests the when, not under one of a place the move can't touch), and an unfulfilled instance (u_*: listed under the balance of its place, not under another's)"

source card "T's card (invented)"

unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place box: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..

place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..

input fee: money PLN

input on_day: date

input wanted: bool

input d9: date

move maybe: transfers
  on on_day
  when wanted
  leg cash from world to konto amount fee

move rent: transfers
  on on_day
  leg cash from world to box amount fee

ask a_when: bal(konto, d9)

ask a_other: bal(box, d9)

ask u_box: bal(box, d9), bal(konto, d9)

version v_card
  cite card
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  fee = 10.00 PLN "the card"
  on_day = 2026-02-10 "the card"
  wanted = false assumed "a guess: not wanted"
  d9 = 2026-02-28 "the card"
  opening[konto] = 100.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
  opening[box] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "the card"
